// Ch13 B05 "The Sanctum" (P → C, 3 min) and B06 "Ethren" (C, 3.5 min). act2_ch13.md §2. Kerrid is NOT here
// (rule 3). S01: the basin: water held so still it is a perfect mirror, lit from beneath by a steady light
// (glimmer_bound: the thing the Order forbids); pilgrims humming on the kneeling steps. S02: LISS LOOKS AT THE
// LIGHT and says NOTHING; hold past comfort. S03: Ysolde's voice of twenty-four years. S04: the gilt line on
// Asha's face (N-04). S05: Ethren rises out of the mirror WITHOUT A RIPPLE; a plain copper ring on one
// gauntleted finger. S06: Ysolde stands before her husband with a Cantor beside her for the first time.
// S07: the sixth verse comes out of the still light in a patient, kind man's voice (`ethren_bound`; no words
// written here: Audio's Lamptongue); Ysolde closes her eyes on the first word; the sleeve reaches S6.
// S08: the veiled head turns once toward Ysolde (the veil never falls: Act III's).
title: ch13_ethren
location: ch13/sanctum
---
@letterbox on
@camera S01
@music sanctum_of_the_level fade=2.0
@vfx glimmer_bound at=basin_light count=1
@wait 5.0
@camera S02
@mark liss basin_rim walk
@anim liss look_at basin_light
@wait 8.0
@camera S03
Ysolde [neutral]: The Saints are at peace. I visit my husband every year. He has never once been anything but at peace. #line:ch13_ethren_001
@anim asha take_hand ysolde
@wait 2.0
@camera S04
@anim tender paint_gilt_line asha
@wait 3.0
@camera S05
@vfx glimmer_bound at=ethren count=1
@wait 4.0
@camera S06
@mark ysolde before_ethren walk
@anim ysolde look_at ethren_ring
@wait 4.0
@camera S07
@anim asha raise_staff
@music ethren_bound fade=0.0
@anim ysolde close_eyes
@wait 8.0
@vfx glimmer_bound at=asha_sleeve count=6
@wait 2.0
@camera S08
@anim ethren turn_head ysolde
@wait 3.0
@camera S09
Ysolde [grief]: Thank you, Lady Cantor. #line:ch13_ethren_002
<<set $ch13_ethren_bound = true>>
@music sanctum_of_the_level fade=2.0
@wait 2.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
